{
 "encounter_id": "00906",
 "speakers": {
  "person_1": "PATIENT",
  "person_2": "DOCTOR"
 },
 "turns": [
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "I get headaches in the afternoon, and I wonder if it's my eyes."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Good question. Where do you feel the headache?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Across my forehead, and sometimes behind the eyes."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "How long have you had them?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "About three weeks. Since I started the new job at the computer."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "How many hours a day are you looking at a screen? ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Eight or nine. Sometimes more. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Do you notice blurred vision, or double vision?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Blurred, towards the end of the day. Words go a bit fuzzy."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Any flashing lights, or vomiting with the headache?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "No. Nothing like that."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Do you take anything for the headache?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Ibuprofen, 400 mg, when it's bad. Maybe twice a week."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "And have you ever had your eyes tested?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Not since school. I had glasses then, but I lost them."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Any allergies I should know about, to medicines?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "No, none that I know of."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Any long-term conditions, or family history of eye problems?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "My mother has glaucoma."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "That's important, thank you. I'll check your blood pressure and pulse. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Okay.",
   "pause": 10.0
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Blood pressure 118 over 76, pulse 68, temperature 36.5, oxygen 99 percent, breathing 14."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Is it all right? ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Perfect. I think this is eye strain, from the screen time and probably needing glasses again."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "That's a relief. I was worried it was something worse. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "With your mother's glaucoma, I'd like an optician to measure the pressure in your eyes too."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Can I book it myself? ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Yes, a full eye test, and tell them about your mother."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "I'll do it this week. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Meanwhile, take a break every twenty minutes and look at something far away."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "The twenty-twenty rule, I've heard of it. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Exactly. And adjust the screen so it isn't glaring."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "I'll move my desk away from the window. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "If you get sudden loss of vision, eye pain, or vomiting with the headache, go to the emergency department."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Understood. Thanks, doctor. ~"
  }
 ],
